      <VERS vnumber="16"> For it <gr str="1342">increaseth</gr>. Thou <gr str="6679">huntest </gr>me as a fierce <gr str="7826">lion</gr>: and <gr str="7725">again </gr>thou showest thyself <gr str="6381">marvelous </gr>upon me. </VERS>
